                note: "Logic level is 1.8 V by default (the nPM1300 PMIC\'s VOUT1); set 1.8-3.3 V with \'VDD (nPM VOUT1)\' in nRF Connect for Desktop\'s Board Configurator. VCOM1 TXD to the debugger through analog switch U4/U5, tri-stated until a terminal sends DTR.",
            ),
            PinDef(
                number: 29,
